{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The nameless stands his ground. He is determined to bring his friend back and do his best to make his crew complete once more. He stares directly at the thunder bird to show that he's not afraid. But his stare isn't one of arrogance, behind his eyes is a feeling of loss and melancholy. His stare is one of steel and iron will.","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:05:50.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867331527003996220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
