{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The nameless rejoices at the sight of the feather. Before he brings his hand up. \"May I ask for a crystalline feather?\" He asks hesitantly, still unsure of the intelligence of the bird before him. \"I need it to see my best friend again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:08:17.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867332146230460426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"It blinks and moves to within inches of you. You can see through the lense 10 feet to the back of it's eye","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:08:48.352000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T09:08:54.879000Z","id":"867332273899569163","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The nameless stands mesmerized for a moment at the sight. He then blinks to regain focus and moves to pluck the crystalline feather off, taking the bird moving closer a sign of it giving permission to him. \"Thank you\" He says, learning from Meorys's interaction with Cael'fii to thank powerful entities.","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:10:44.855000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867332762548568074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thrice was the asking. Thrice was the answering. A Payment offered. \nThrice we shall ask. Thrice you shall answer.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:11:47.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867333026656157698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The thunder bird stands up, but stays to bare witness.","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:12:28.939000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867333199108243456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The nameless turns towards the ravens, ready to answer. \"It's always three with you guys huh.\" The elation from getting the item needed for Irynx's list making the nameless try for a slight joke. \"Ask and I shall answer.\" He adds, this time seriously.","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:13:09.530000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867333369360810004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What is your life's path?\" (class plus any character arc goals.)","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:13:53.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867333553401364490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I may not be the strongest or make the wisest of decisions. But all I want is th ability to protect and support my friends. I want to be someone they can depend on and trust. I know I went here before in pursuit of something selfish and inconsequential. I have paid to learn my lesson, thanks to you both. I no longer want power for the sake of having it, I want power so that I may use it to protect my friends. If I have to serve you to get that power, then I shall.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:17:53.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867334561637335041","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(warlock is the best choice because of 15 cha, keeping sorcerer but with raven stuff is also fine if that's a choice, yeah shadow maybe)","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:18:10.082000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T09:20:23.247000Z","id":"867334629967003688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Once have you asked. Once have you answered. \"\n\"Would you give us the memory of your trauma as payment?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:21:23.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867335443136643072","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I have learned from our previous encounter. Memories are integral to our identities, even the saddest ones. If I give you the memory of Irynx dying then I would wake up not knowing why I went here and did all this now would I?\" The nameless calmly smiles. \"I wish to offer the memories of the lessons and books about history instead.\" (losing history proficiency is the point for the suggestion)","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:24:00.463000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867336099571302400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Would you speak for the dead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:25:59.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867336600564662302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Twice Asked. Twice answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:26:16.486000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867336670092984340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Seeing as I know what the dead have to go through on the other side, I will gladly be their voice.\" The nameless responds plainly, glad to be of help to those who would need it.","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:27:06.298000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867336879018606604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thrice Asked. Thrice Answered.\"\n\n\"You shall be our speaker for the dead.\" (Bard collage of spirits. Once per week you may gain the spirit tag to interact with dead players as they deal with the powers that be.)\n\n\"The unending cycle of death and rebirth is a strain on the souls of Empire City. Never are they given last rights. Never are words to mark their life give. It is a mechanical rush to the nearest holy place that they might live once again. Honor the dead. Speak of their peace, that they may make wise decisions and learn from their deaths.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:31:05.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867337882074480660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"No longer simply nameless. Your title shall serve as a moniker that you may respond to, if you so choose. We thank and trust you. Speaker for the Dead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:32:57.763000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867338353170448394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The ravens depart.","created_at":"2021-07-21T09:33:09.981000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867338404416978985","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
